# Who may publish/subscribe to what (copy to /etc/mosquitto/bluehanded.acl).
# Nodes can only send scans/status and read config; only the server reads scans.

user bluehanded-server
topic read blue-handed/scan/#
topic read blue-handed/status/#
topic write blue-handed/config/#

user bluehanded-node
topic write blue-handed/scan/#
topic readwrite blue-handed/status/#
topic read blue-handed/config/#
